      "id": 19830,
      "name": "Wynn",
      "username": "roonechr",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/roonechr/{size}/5412_2.png",
      "created_at": "2020-04-01T15:35:36.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p><span><span>Guys!</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>If you are on these boards and have not pre-ordered <a href=\"https://www.handelabra.com/spiritisland\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Spirit Island Digital</a> I would highly recommend that you check it out.&nbsp;I've been playing the heck out of the beta and it is awesome. It recreates the feel of the tabletop while handling all of the setup and rules execution so you can play so many more games!</span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span><span>There is still one stretch goal to unlock, and I really want to see huge support for the game at launch so that we get the expansions right quick.&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>This has been a Public Service Announcement. Thank you for your attention : )</span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:53:40.213Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
