      "created_at": "2020-04-04T01:14:25.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I have been watching the videos and I’m VERY excited for it. Initially I most wanted to play Shadows Flicker Like Flame, and they’re still high on my list, but I’ve also learned to love Thunder-Speaker, Vital Strength, Bringer Of Dreams and Nightmares...it will probably be a while before I play Ocean’s Hungry Grasp, but I definitely want to.</p>\n<p>I also want to make theme-teams, like The Pushing Team (Dreams plus Hungry Grasp) or The Dahan Team (River Surges, Thunder-Speaker, and Shadows Flicker)...it looks like so much fun :D</p>",
